<title>USA: FINAL PRICING -- S.C. Housing Finance Authority.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING -- S.C. Housing Finance Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>SOUTH CAROLINA STATE HOUSING FINANCE</p>
<p>AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $30,000,000</p>
<p>MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>FORMAL AWARD.</p>
<p>FINAL PRICING AND AMOUNTS.</p>
<p>	 LEGISLATION HAS BEEN RECENTLY INTRODUCED WHICH WILL</p>
<p>PERMIT THE SOUTH CAROLINA STATE HOUSING FINANCE AND</p>
<p>DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY TO PROVIDE CREDIT ENHANCEMENTS TO</p>
<p>SELECTED ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS LOCATED IN THE STATE.</p>
<p>ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT AND OTHER STATE OFFICIALS HAVE SUGGESTED</p>
<p>THAT THE AUTHORITY PROVIDE SUCH AN ENHANCEMENT TO A PROPOSED</p>
<p>RETIREMENT VILLAGE WHICH IS TO BE LOCATED IN LANCASTER COUNTY,</p>
<p>SOUTH CAROLINA.  THE ASSETS BEING REVIEWED TO COLLATERALIZE</p>
<p>THIS CREDIT ENHANCEMENT CONSIST OF (i) EXCESS REVENUE</p>
<p>AVAILABLE TO THE AUTHORITY UNDER ITS OUTSTANDING SINGLE FAMILY</p>
<p>RESIDENTIAL RESOLUTIONS (INCLUDING THE GENERAL BOND</p>
<p>RESOLUTION); (ii) MONEYS AND INVESTMENTS HELD BY THE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>IN FUNDS UNDER ITS VARIOUS RESOLUTIONS (INCLUDING THE GENERAL</p>
<p>BOND RESOLUTION) IN EXCESS OF THE AMOUNTS REQUIRED TO BE HELD</p>
<p>IN SUCH FUNDS; (iii) MORTGAGE LOANS MADE BY THE AUTHORITY FROM</p>
<p>MONEYS OTHER THAN PROCEEDS OF THE SALE OF THE BONDS AND</p>
<p>PREPAYMENTS OF MORTGAGE LOANS; AND (iv) ANY OTHER AVAILABLE</p>
<p>ASSETS OR FUNDS.</p>
<p>	 AT THIS TIME THE AUTHORITY CANNOT ASSESS THE ECONOMIC</p>
<p>IMPACT OF THIS PROPOSED LEGISLATION.  THE AUTHORITY'S BONDS</p>
<p>ARE SPECIAL OBLIGATIONS SECURED BY THE ASSETS PLEDGED UNDER</p>
<p>THE RESOLUTIONS AND ARE NOT FULL FAITH AND CREDIT OBLIGATIONS</p>
<p>OF THE AUTHORITY.</p>
<p>	 MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE HAS SINCE RECONFIRMED THE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING RATINGS OF THE OFFERED BONDS AT Aa2 AND AMBAC HAS</p>
<p>ALSO RECONFIRMED THEIR COMMITMENT TO INSURE THE BONDS.  AS A</p>
<p>RESULT, THE MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997 WILL BE RATED</p>
<p>Aaa/AAA (MOODY'S / S&amp;P).</p>
